@startuml
!include ../_shared/style.puml
title Google Calendar Webhook — token 検証・重複抑止・同期開始
hide footbox
autonumber
participant "Google push 通知\n<T001>" as T001
participant "Worker HTTP API\n<A001>" as A001
participant "StateStore\n<C002>" as C002
participant "Default\n<C001>" as C001
participant "外部同期サブシステム\n<P014>" as P014
T001 -> A001: [E003] 入力: X-Goog-Channel-Token・channel ID・message number
A001 -> A001: method=POST と channel token を検証
alt method・Secret・token が不正
  A001 --> T001: [E004] 出力: HTTP 401・405・503
else 認証済み通知
  A001 -> C002: [E140] 入力: channel ID・message number
  C002 --> A001: [E141] 出力: duplicated
  alt 重複通知
    A001 --> T001: [E004] 出力: HTTP 204
  else 初回通知
    A001 -> C001: [E005] 入力: request・source=webhook
    C001 -> P014: [E008] 入力: env・state・起動元
    P014 --> C001: [E009] 出力: 同期結果
    C001 --> A001: [E006] 出力: Response
    alt 同期結果が 500 未満
      A001 --> T001: [E004] 出力: HTTP 204
    else 同期失敗
      A001 --> T001: [E004] 出力: HTTP 500
    end
  end
end
note over T001,A001: watch 登録時と受信時に同じ channel token を使う。Edge 側制御と実配信は未確認。
@enduml
